  - parameter: T_ex = 10 K and 50 K; 3 sigma threshold for upper limits with mean cloud FWHM [3.1.4 Derivation of the total column de…: "Because the adopted approach does not allow to estimate the excitation temperature, $T_{\rm ex}$, we have assumed a range of $T_{\rm ex}$ which can be considered typical or reasonable for IRDC cores, i.e. $\sim 10 -50$ K."] [3.1.4 Derivation of the total column de…: "The assumed FWHM is the mean value measured from the N$^{15}$NH$^+$ lines detected in each cloud."]
