- result: N(CO+)/N(HCO+) toward J1744-3116 = <0.042 ± 3 sigma upper limit dimensionless [Table 3: "J1744-3416 | $23.35 \pm0.06$ | $< 0.98$ | $<$0.042 | $<1.3 \times 10^{-10}$"]
- result: N(CO+)/N(H2) toward J1744-3116 = <1.3e-10 ± 3 sigma upper limit dimensionless [Table 3: "J1744-3416 | $23.35 \pm0.06$ | $< 0.98$ | $<$0.042 | $<1.3 \times 10^{-10}$"]
- result: Fractional rms flux density, J1717-3342 = 0.22% ± not stated percent of continuum flux density [3.2 CO+ as a source of HCO+: "achieved fractional rms flux density levels $\Delta{\rm S}_\nu/{\rm S}_\nu$ of 0.22% and 0.83% for J1717-3342 and J1744-3116 respectively"]
