- result: Aperture radius for Sigma_HCN-vib = 1 Lsun/pc^2 at 1-sigma luminosity limit = r < 2-15 pc, median r < 10 pc ± not stated pc [4.1.1 Impact of Spatial Resolution: "with $r<$ $2-15$ pc and a median upper limit of $r<$ 10 pc"]
