  - fitting: Least-squares minimization of deviations from exp(-tau) over central optical depth, velocity, and FWHM [4. Component decomposition: "varying the central optical depth, central velocity, and profile FWHM while minimizing deviations from the observed line/continuum ratio exp(-tau)."]
