  - validation: Same lines in three independent instruments, 1:2 intensity ratio and spacing [4 New SH+ spectroscopic parameters: "the two emission lines, each observed $\sim$15 MHz higher, had the expected 1 : 2 intensity ratio and spacing"]
- result: SH+ line rest frequency (F=1.5-0.5) = 345944.35 ± 0.2 MHz (systematic) MHz [3 Observational results: "we obtain 345944.35 MHz and 345858.27 MHz for the two lines"]
- result: SH+ line rest frequency (F=0.5-0.5) = 345858.27 ± 0.2 MHz (systematic) MHz [3 Observational results: "we obtain 345944.35 MHz and 345858.27 MHz for the two lines"]
