- result: Ridge velocity component = 38-41 ± not stated km s^-1 [Discussion and conclusions: "From the scousepy analysis, the elongation toward the ridge has velocity in the range 38-41 km s$^{-1}$"]
- result: Inner-cloud velocity components = 41-43; 43-45.5 ± not stated km s^-1 [Discussion and conclusions: "the eastern elongation splits into two spatially separated velocity components at 41-43 and 43-45.5 km s$^{-1}$, respectively."]
