  - fitting: UltraNest comparison with the Table 2 CRIR prior. [New Collisional Rates Analysis: "Here we include CRIR as a free parameter using the prior distribution provided in Table [2](#tab:priors)."] [New Collisional Rates Analysis: "The `UltraNest` inference results using the old and new rates"]
